OHOS: pnpm overrides for packages that have no upstream openharmony binding.

- lightningcss, the yuku-* parsers/codegens, @ast-grep/napi, oxlint-tsgolint
  and @parcel/watcher are replaced by their @ohos-npm-ports builds.
- The three @napi-rs packages (wasm-tools, lzma, tar) have no OHOS build; the
  ohos-shims directories wrap their linux-arm64-musl twins, which share OHOS's
  libc family. The formula copies the .node files in at build time.
- @ohos-npm-ports/* is excluded from the 24h minimumReleaseAge gate, which
  would otherwise block a freshly published port.

Keys must carry the version for the yuku packages (several ranges are in one
graph), but bare for oxlint-tsgolint (packages/cli declares it via catalog:).
Check the versions again whenever the source tag or a port is bumped.

